    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 1 of 4 heroes each with unique bonuses to elevate your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melissa Epic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah Sahara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doug Ocean</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create networks of walking, biking, road and train paths.\u00a0 Connect industries and cities together.\u00a0 Bridge across the water.\u00a0 Sail and fly.\u00a0\u00a0Launch rockets that turn into money making satellites.\u00a0 Remove cows with the Alien Transport ship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Quantum Research building to increase your research point yield, money yield, transportation speed and total vehicle cap.\u00a0 Pushing your potential beyond its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play natures game of luck for a quick and powerful buck as you roll the dice and hope to attain the rarest fishing loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the game alone or with a friend cooperating to progress at your own pace and conquer the world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 1 of 4 heroes each with unique bonuses to elevate your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >John Transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melissa Epic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah Sahara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doug Ocean</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create networks of walking, biking, road and train paths.\u00a0 Connect industries and cities together.\u00a0 Bridge across the water.\u00a0 Sail and fly.\u00a0\u00a0Launch rockets that turn into money making satellites.\u00a0 Remove cows with the Alien Transport ship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Quantum Research building to increase your research point yield, money yield, transportation speed and total vehicle cap.\u00a0 Pushing your potential beyond its limits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play natures game of luck for a quick and powerful buck as you roll the dice and hope to attain the rarest fishing loot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle the game alone or with a friend cooperating to progress at your own pace and conquer the world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
